title: "AgroStake: Edge AI for Grapevine Disease Detection on the ESP32-S3"
version: 0.1.1
date-released: 2026-10-29
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/XareDev/agrostake"
url: "https://github.com/XareDev/agrostake"
keywords:
  - grapevine disease
  - plant disease detection
  - ESP32-S3
  - ESP-DL
  - edge AI
  - TinyML
  - knowledge distillation
authors:
  - family-names: Harmouni
    given-names: Youcef
