abstract: >-
  AgroStake is a compact grapevine leaf disease classifier designed for the
  ESP32-S3. It includes four-class RGB and grayscale models, a binary
  healthy/diseased gate experiment, training and evaluation scripts, ONNX
  export, INT8 ESP-DL artefacts, and UART, USB-Serial-JTAG, and Wi-Fi firmware
  variants. The repository documents the measured results and the provenance
  of every released model.
